{"unit_id":"YiYan129600__dsh-mobile-access#feature-1","repo":"YiYan129600/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"15812c8ad76b675c8e10d1ef20910179a79486fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"手机接入向导的功能「扫码配对」：设置页生成含一次性令牌的二维码，手机扫码后建立设备凭证并进入欢迎页。令牌首次成功使用后失效，配对设备记录会保存到本机数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:286-320","lib/index.js:1440-1471","lib/index.js:1400-1402"]}
{"unit_id":"YiYan129600__dsh-mobile-access#feature-2","repo":"YiYan129600/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"15812c8ad76b675c8e10d1ef20910179a79486fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"手机接入向导的功能「连接方式选择」：用户在设置页选择直连地址或 HTTP/2 域名；页面探测地址和 API 状态，并在确认后生成相应的扫码链接。HTTP/2 服务可从页面启停。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1440-1471","lib/index.js:1473-1490","lib/index.js:1508-1525"]}
{"unit_id":"YiYan129600__dsh-mobile-access#feature-3","repo":"YiYan129600/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"15812c8ad76b675c8e10d1ef20910179a79486fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"手机接入向导的功能「设备管理」：配对后，设置页可查看设备信息和在线状态，并撤销单台设备或清除全部配对设备；设备凭证写入 DSH 数据目录以便重启后继续使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:343-352","lib/index.js:372-380","lib/index.js:1400-1402","lib/index.js:1558-1572"]}
{"unit_id":"YiYan129600__dsh-mobile-access#feature-4","repo":"YiYan129600/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"15812c8ad76b675c8e10d1ef20910179a79486fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"手机接入向导的功能「会话通知」：配对设备连接通知流后，DSH 会把回合完成、提问、待办变化或工具错误转换成简短事件，页面可显示实时提醒，也可向已订阅设备发送 Web Push。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1046-1110","lib/index.js:1409-1427","lib/index.js:1620-1656","lib/index.js:1659-1688"]}
{"unit_id":"YiYan129600__dsh-mobile-access#feature-5","repo":"YiYan129600/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"15812c8ad76b675c8e10d1ef20910179a79486fe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"手机接入向导的功能「主屏安装资源」：宿主页面注入 PWA manifest、主题色和触屏图标，并提供 service worker 与配对欢迎页，方便用户将 DSH Web 添加到手机主屏。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:462-497","lib/index.js:513-545","lib/index.js:1588-1605","lib/index.js:1689-1695"]}
